{"id": "NC-I4-START-TIMEOUT-ABSENT", "category": "required", "what": "an uncertain StartTransientUnit (timeout, error, malformed reply) is taken as no effect: nothing is owned, nothing reconciled", "files": ["crates/nexus-verifier-sandbox/src/scope/pending.rs"], "edits": 1, "test": "scope::tests::i4_03_a_start_with_effect_whose_reply_is_lost_is_discovered_and_proven", "marker": "the unit a lost-reply start created was not discovered and proven", "test_passes_unmutated": true, "compiled": true, "failed_intended_test": true, "marker_in_assertion": true, "files_restored": true, "exit": 101, "ok": true, "assertion": "Timeout: the unit a lost-reply start created was not discovered and proven: StartFailed { error: Bus(\"StartTransientUnit timed out\"), unresolved: None }"}
{"id": "NC-I4-START-LOST-OWNER", "category": "required", "what": "a start that failed or stayed uncertain returns its error with no owner for what it may have created", "files": ["crates/nexus-verifier-sandbox/src/execution.rs"], "edits": 1, "test": "execution::tests::i4_21_an_unconfirmed_operation_is_a_cleanup_failure_never_an_unavailable_sandbox", "marker": "an unconfirmed scope operation was reported as an unavailable sandbox with confirmed cleanup", "test_passes_unmutated": true, "compiled": true, "failed_intended_test": true, "marker_in_assertion": true, "files_restored": true, "exit": 101, "ok": true, "assertion": "assertion `left == right` failed: an unconfirmed scope operation was reported as an unavailable sandbox with confirmed cleanup\n  left: SandboxUnavailable\n right: CleanupFailed"}
{"id": "NC-I4-START-NAME-AUTH", "category": "required", "what": "the unit name alone locates and proves the scope (its cgroup taken beside the helper's, no membership or process-list proof)", "files": ["crates/nexus-verifier-sandbox/src/scope/pending.rs"], "edits": 2, "test": "execution::tests::i4_16_a_pending_operation_is_never_proven_by_its_unit_name", "marker": "a scope was proven by its unit name", "test_passes_unmutated": true, "compiled": true, "failed_intended_test": true, "marker_in_assertion": true, "files_restored": true, "exit": 101, "ok": true, "assertion": "a scope was proven by its unit name: Some(Launch(SetupFailed { stage: Protocol, errno: 0 }))"}
{"id": "NC-I4-LAUNCH-PENDING", "category": "required", "what": "the helper is handshaken and launched whatever the scope's state (pending included)", "files": ["crates/nexus-verifier-sandbox/src/execution.rs"], "edits": 1, "test": "execution::tests::i4_18_no_launch_message_reaches_the_helper_before_the_scope_is_proven", "marker": "a launch message reached the helper before the proof", "test_passes_unmutated": true, "compiled": true, "failed_intended_test": true, "marker_in_assertion": true, "files_restored": true, "exit": 101, "ok": true, "assertion": "assertion `left == right` failed: case 0: a launch message reached the helper before the proof\n  left: 71\n right: 0"}
{"id": "NC-I4-NO-EARLY-DIR", "category": "required", "what": "the candidate's descriptor is kept only once every proof passed, not as soon as the helper is seen in it", "files": ["crates/nexus-verifier-sandbox/src/scope/pending.rs"], "edits": 2, "test": "execution::tests::i4_10_an_uncertain_query_after_the_candidate_keeps_its_descriptor", "marker": "the candidate retained before the uncertain query was not kept", "test_passes_unmutated": true, "compiled": true, "failed_intended_test": true, "marker_in_assertion": true, "files_restored": true, "exit": 101, "ok": true, "assertion": "the candidate retained before the uncertain query was not kept"}
{"id": "NC-I4-PROPERTY-ERROR-DROPS", "category": "required", "what": "an uncertain property read (RuntimeMaxUSec, OOMPolicy) drops the retained candidate", "files": ["crates/nexus-verifier-sandbox/src/scope/pending.rs"], "edits": 2, "test": "execution::tests::i4_04_a_property_timeout_after_placement_never_launches_and_keeps_the_candidate", "marker": "cleanup not confirmed through the retained candidate", "test_passes_unmutated": true, "compiled": true, "failed_intended_test": true, "marker_in_assertion": true, "files_restored": true, "exit": 101, "ok": true, "assertion": "cleanup not confirmed through the retained candidate"}
{"id": "NC-I4-STOP-OK-CONFIRMS", "category": "required", "what": "a delivered StopUnit reply is taken as cleanup confirmation", "files": ["crates/nexus-verifier-sandbox/src/scope/pending.rs"], "edits": 1, "test": "execution::tests::i4_07_a_delivered_stop_reply_with_the_scope_still_populated_confirms_nothing", "marker": "a delivered StopUnit reply was taken as cleanup", "test_passes_unmutated": true, "compiled": true, "failed_intended_test": true, "marker_in_assertion": true, "files_restored": true, "exit": 101, "ok": true, "assertion": "assertion `left == right` failed: a delivered StopUnit reply was taken as cleanup\n  left: SandboxUnavailable\n right: CleanupFailed"}
{"id": "NC-I4-STOP-ERR-NO-EFFECT", "category": "required", "what": "a StopUnit error reply is taken as proof that nothing was there to stop", "files": ["crates/nexus-verifier-sandbox/src/scope/pending.rs"], "edits": 1, "test": "execution::tests::i4_06_a_failed_stop_of_a_unit_the_helper_never_entered_retains_the_operation", "marker": "a StopUnit error was taken as proof that nothing remained", "test_passes_unmutated": true, "compiled": true, "failed_intended_test": true, "marker_in_assertion": true, "files_restored": true, "exit": 101, "ok": true, "assertion": "assertion `left == right` failed: a StopUnit error was taken as proof that nothing remained\n  left: SandboxUnavailable\n right: CleanupFailed"}
